  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v11.0.7:  Updated NuGet dependencies: Microsoft.Extensions.* to 11.0.0, Microsoft.Extensions.Caching.Hybrid to 10.11.0, StackExchange.Redis to 3.4.31\n\t\tv11.0.6:\n\t\t- Updated NuGet dependencies: StackExchange.Redis to 3.3.1\n\t\tv11.0.5:\n\t\t- Updated NuGet dependencies: Microsoft.Extensions.* to 10.0.12, Microsoft.Extensions.Caching.Hybrid to 10.10.0, StackExchange.Redis to 3.2.1\n\t\tv11.0.4:\n\t\t-   Update Nuget package references\n\t\tv11.0.2:\n\t\t- Updated NuGet dependencies: Microsoft.Extensions.* to 10.0.10, Microsoft.Extensions.Caching.Hybrid to 10.8.0, StackExchange.Redis to 3.1.13\n\t\tv11.0.1:\n\t\t- Minor bug fixes and improvements\n\t\tv11.0.0:\n\t\t- Added HybridCache support with two-level caching (L1 in-memory + L2 Redis)\n\t\t- Added stampede protection via HybridCache\n\t\t- Added structured logging throughout AzureRedisCache class\n\t\t- New AddAzureHybridCache() DI extension methods\n\t\t- New HybridCacheConfiguration for customizable cache options\n\t\t- Updated sample app with modern Bootstrap 5 UI\n\t\t- Comprehensive README with best practices and examples",
